// ListRecruitCommits: Commitment changes seen between weekly syncs, newest first: `commit` (with `previous_school` when it was a flip), `decommit`, `sign`. Changes before the league's first recruit sync aren't known; /recruits shows the current commitments.
//
// GET /v1/recruits/commits
